    "detailed_description": "<h1>PARTY ANIMALS DELUXE EDITION</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/862c85960bfdf3f06f16ad90948953a9.avif?t=1753424021\" /></div><br>Deluxe Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Party Animals Base Game<br></li><li>Nemo Bucks*1300<br></li><li>Bathrobe Harry Outfit &amp; Avatar &amp; Frame<br></li><li>Bathrobe Coco Outfit &amp; Avatar &amp; Frame<br></li><li>Bathrobe Garfat Outfit &amp; Avatar &amp; Frame<br></li><li>Golden Nemo Skin &amp; Avatar<br></li><li>Golden Macchiato Skin &amp; Avatar<br></li><li>Golden Coco Skin &amp; Avatar</li></ul></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Make Painfully Great Memories with Your Friends in Party Animals. </h2><br><br><strong> Mess With Your Friend in 100 Different Ways</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/ea12341010fbbd13bf0b82e0a7040c32.poster.avif?t=1753424021\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/ea12341010fbbd13bf0b82e0a7040c32.webm?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/ea12341010fbbd13bf0b82e0a7040c32.mp4?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Or Together You Could Eliminate Others</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/95cf7e1dc2d7f4d911d6c9e9060f5970.poster.avif?t=1753424021\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/95cf7e1dc2d7f4d911d6c9e9060f5970.webm?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/95cf7e1dc2d7f4d911d6c9e9060f5970.mp4?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Teamwork Is Also Highly Appreciated Here</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/5faa7b31f1abe75f4a8cfb9fb8108cf6.poster.avif?t=1753424021\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/5faa7b31f1abe75f4a8cfb9fb8108cf6.webm?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/5faa7b31f1abe75f4a8cfb9fb8108cf6.mp4?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Especially When Fighting For Gummy Bear</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/4cf540798fcc50835c2cded3409b219a.poster.avif?t=1753424021\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/4cf540798fcc50835c2cded3409b219a.webm?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1260320/extras/4cf540798fcc50835c2cded3409b219a.mp4?t=1753424021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
